<title>USA: Hvide Marine Q1 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Hvide Marine Q1 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997	  1996</p>
<p> Revenue						39.7	   20.2</p>
<p> EBITDA						 13.4	    4.4</p>
<p> Income from Operations			    9.7	    2.7</p>
<p>Net Income before</p>
<p>  Extraordinary Item				 4.6	     --</p>
<p>Net Income (Loss) Per Share before</p>
<p>  Extraordinary Item				0.33	 (0.01)</p>
<p>Net Income after Extraordinary</p>
<p>  Item						   2.9	     --</p>
<p>Net Income (Loss) Per Share after</p>
<p>  Extraordinary Item				0.21	 (0.01)</p>
<p> Average Shares Outstanding	     13,835,722    2,534,840</p>
<p>($ millions except per share)</p>
<p>NOTE: First quarter 1997 net income of $4.6 million or $0.33 per share before an extraordinary item on revenues of $39.7 million.</p>
<p>The 1997 first quarter saw the completion of an additional public stock offering of 4,000,000 shares of Class A common stock at a price of $24.875 per share.</p>
